        <plot formula="PlotLines([4.1,4.45],[0.63,0.63])" linecolor="#117A65" linethickness="1.8"/>
        <planecontainer origin="4.55,0.6,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#29333D">
          <textvalue>uplift: Pu</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <planecontainer origin="5.152,0.6,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#29333D" formula="PileDesignPier.P_u_4/(1 kip)">
          <num>-11.810</num>
        </planecontainer>
        <planecontainer origin="5.598,0.6,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#29333D">
          <textvalue>kip</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
      </canvas>
    </embed>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Figure 2. Combined axial load and flexure: the bilinear envelope of LRFD 6.9.2.2.1 (compression and tension) from the live corner values, with the governing records as live points.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True">9. Shear (LRFD 6.12.1.2.3b)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="V_u_sh = V_res_3 to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>V_u_sh = V_res_3 to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 18.700 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">resultant shear of the governing record</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="F_cr1 = 1.6*E_s/(Sqrt(L_v/D_out)*D_t^1.25) to ksi" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>F_cr1 = 1.6*E_s/(Sqrt(L_v/D_out)*D_t^1.25) to ksi</expbody>
        <expresult> = 142.711 ksi</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">shear buckling stress, Eq. 6.12.1.2.3b-2</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="F_cr2 = 0.78*E_s/D_t^1.5 to ksi" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>F_cr2 = 0.78*E_s/D_t^1.5 to ksi</expbody>
        <expresult> = 84.103 ksi</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">shear buckling stress, Eq. 6.12.1.2.3b-3</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="F_cr = Min(Max(F_cr1, F_cr2), 0.58*Fy) to ksi" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>F_cr = Min(Max(F_cr1, F_cr2), 0.58*Fy) to ksi</expbody>
        <expresult> = 26.100 ksi</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">flexural shear buckling resistance</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="V_n = 0.5*F_cr*A_g to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>V_n = 0.5*F_cr*A_g to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 384.133 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">nominal shear resistance</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="V_r = phi_v_steel*V_n to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>V_r = phi_v_steel*V_n to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 384.133 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">factored shear resistance</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_shear = V_u_sh/V_r" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_shear = V_u_sh/V_r</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.049</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">shear D/C</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True">10. Geotechnical resistance (SDG 3.5.13)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6">SDG Eq. 3-1: Rn &gt;= (Factored Design Load + Net Scour Resistance + Downdrag) / phi. The downdrag enters nominally; the minimum tip elevation, scour and test-pile length of the Pile Data Table come from the geotechnical handoff.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="FDL_tons = FDL_fbmp/(2 kip)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>FDL_tons = FDL_fbmp/(2 kip)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 112.315</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Factored Design Load, tons (strength head compression, without downdrag)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="R_scour_net = R_scour_net_tons*2*(1 kip) to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>R_scour_net = R_scour_net_tons*2*(1 kip) to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.000 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">net scour resistance</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="R_n_req = (FDL_fbmp + R_scour_net + DD)/phi_geo to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>R_n_req = (FDL_fbmp + R_scour_net + DD)/phi_geo to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 299.507 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">required nominal bearing resistance, SDG Eq. 3-1</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="NBR_tons = R_n_req/(2 kip)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>NBR_tons = R_n_req/(2 kip)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 149.753</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">required nominal bearing resistance, tons (Pile Data Table column C)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True" pagebreakbefore="break">11. Summary of checks</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_max = Max(DC_slender, DC_klr, DC_axial, DC_comb, DC_shear, DC_t, DC_sp)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_max = Max(DC_slender, DC_klr, DC_axial, DC_comb, DC_shear, DC_t, DC_sp)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 1.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">largest of the check ratios</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="Status = If(DC_max &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ All Checks Pass&quot;, &quot;⊗ There are FAILURES&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="False" showresult="True" showsteps="False" style="Result only" showidentifier="False">
        <expbody>Status = If(DC_max &lt;= 1, "✓ All Checks Pass", "⊗ There are FAILURES")</expbody>
        <expresult>✓ All Checks Pass</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">numerical checks of this calculation</paragraph>
    <section name="Checks" capture="False" hide="true">
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_slender = If(DC_slender &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_slender = If(DC_slender &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_klr = If(DC_klr &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_klr = If(DC_klr &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_axial = If(DC_axial &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_axial = If(DC_axial &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_comb = If(DC_comb &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_comb = If(DC_comb &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_shear = If(DC_shear &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_shear = If(DC_shear &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_t = If(DC_t &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_t = If(DC_t &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_sp = If(DC_sp &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_sp = If(DC_sp &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
    </section>
