    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Figure 3. Demand/capacity ratio of each check (stems) against the 1.0 limit. The stems are live formulas of the check ratios: a stem turns red when its ratio passes 1.0.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C" background="#F1F5FA">Check numbers: 1 local buckling D/t; 2 KL/r; 3 axial compression; 4 axial + flexure, 6.9.2.2.1; 5 shear; 6 tension; 7 pile spacing.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C" background="#F1F5FA">FB-MultiPier reports a largest model D/C of 0.29 at combo 2 STRENGTH-III · pile 4 · element 13J · EL 16.55 ft.</paragraph>
  </report>
